planstatus at planning 0
ctxinput at planning 1
transport at planning 3
z rec 0 0 0
s rec planstatus z transport
scanstate rec s 0 0
nf get ctxinput 11
scan loop aj_scan_more aj_scan_step nf scanstate ctxinput
state at scan 0
strict at scan 1
collision at scan 2
ctx set ctxinput 14 strict
head call aj_prelude state 0 ctx 0 0
s1 fold aj_strict_runtime strict head ctx 0 0
none eq collision 0
makecount select none 1 0
s2 fold aj_make_export makecount s1 ctx 0 0
nt get ctx 12
count sub nt 3
shapes loop aj_program_more aj_shape count s2 ctx 0 0
body loop aj_program_more aj_function nf shapes ctx 0 0
result call ew_public body
ret result
end
